{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_vrtx_016pahmQYMCqDXpYKJT3WhMc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done. I wrote **`ai-engineering/answers/06-001-data-pre-processing-and-feature-engineering.md`** — the answer note for Q1: *Data pre-processing and feature engineering?*\n\nKey content:\n- **Framing:** probes end-to-end pipeline thinking and awareness of data leakage as the root cause of most production ML failures\n- **Answer:** full 6-stage pre-processing pipeline (audit → impute → encode → scale → feature engineer → leakage prevention) with scikit-learn `Pipeline` + `ColumnTransformer` as the mechanical leakage guard\n- **Concrete example:** fraud detection case study (Stripe-style) — PR-AUC from 0.54 → 0.81 using the full stack\n- **Production angle:** feature stores (Feast, Tecton) for training-serving consistency at latency SLOs\n- **Pitfalls:** fitting scalers on full data before split, using accuracy for imbalanced classes, scaling for tree-based models\n- **Cross-links:** Q11 (imbalanced datasets), Q19 (precision/recall in fraud), Q9 (bias-variance)\n\n25 items remain in the Next queue (Q2–Q26 + validate)."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":265,"cache_read_input_tokens":68914,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":265,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0c8ef1f8-b585-4463-9ba7-4b33c5d5f895","uuid":"b5b32c28-2572-45e1-a21c-5c75fab72a3e"}
